            "text_hwiVqH": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Every candle we make starts with honest materials — and when the last of the wax is gone, those materials still have value. Ember Returns is our program for giving jars and lids a second life. Bring them back to us at a market or event, and we'll put them back to work. In exchange, you'll take something off the price of your next one.</p>",
