        "text_qbXiRU": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We source every jar and every lid with intention. The black matte glass is heavy and considered. The red oak lids are cut, sanded, and finished by hand. When a candle burns down, those vessels don't have to end up in a landfill — they can be cleaned, refinished, and poured again. Ember Returns is our way of closing that loop. It keeps materials in the cycle, reduces what we have to source new, and lets us pass a little of that back to you as a thank-you for bringing them home.</p><p></p><p><strong>A well-made object deserves a second life. Ember Returns is how we make that happen.</strong></p>",
